{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/ag-9ine-ag-properties-dubailand","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":734,"crm_id":"365","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"AG 9INE","slug":"ag-9ine-ag-properties-dubailand","display_address":"Dubailand","building_type":["apartment","studio"],"completion_year":"2026","developer":"AG Properties","price":614714,"display_price":"614K","lattitude":25.0873104,"longitude":55.3761068,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":2,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>AG 9INE - a project by AG Properties in the Dubailand neighbourhood. The building has 17 floors, 13 of which house luxury <strong>studios and two-bedroom apartments.</strong> Each residence is equipped with a smart home system and has a fully equipped kitchen with quality furniture and appliances.</p><p>The complex offers residents many first-class amenities, including a swimming pool, gym, green garden with gazebos and barbecue areas, meditation area, children's pool and walking and jogging paths. On the territory there are concierge services, 24-hour security with video surveillance and offices of health services.</p><p>The interiors of the complex are designed in a modern style using gentle light colours, which visually expands the space and creates an atmosphere of comfort and tranquillity.</p><p>The Dubailand community is located along one of Dubai's main motorways, Sheikh Mohammed bin Zayed Road. This enables residents to quickly access the city's major attractions. 9ine is just a short drive from Dubai Outlet Mall, Al Maktoum International Airport and Expo City. Palm Jumeirah, Dubai Marina and Mall Of Emirates are approximately 30 minutes away by car.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/365/images/2023/11/03/bpL